<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Depreciation expense for the six months ended
October 31, 2022 and 2023 amounted to JPY<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c9" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="0" unitRef="jpy" id="ixv-5911">324,216</ix:nonFraction> and JPY<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="0" unitRef="jpy" id="ixv-5912">546,638</ix:nonFraction> (USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-5913">3,610</ix:nonFraction>), respectively.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

