<p style="font: 7pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_OperatingLeasesOfLesseeDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasesOfLesseeDisclosureTextBlock" id="ixv-6086">Supplemental disclosure related to operating leases were as follows:</ix:nonNumeric></p>

